### Variabel Lingkungan
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token_ayah = token-uji-ayah
@token_ibu = token-uji-ibu
@household_id = id-rumah-ayah
@member_id = id-anggota-ibu

### 1. Uji 401: Tanpa Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/household_members?household_id={{household_id}}
Authorization: Bearer 

### 2. Uji 200: Daftar Anggota (Dengan Token Ayah)
GET {{baseUrl}}/household_members?household_id={{household_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_ayah}}

### 3. Uji 201: Tambah Anggota (Oleh Ayah)
POST {{baseUrl}}/household_members
Authorization: Bearer {{token_ayah}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "household_id": "{{household_id}}",
  "user_id": "user-baru-id",
  "role": "anak",
  "display_name": "Anak Baru"
}

### 4. Uji 403: Tambah Anggota oleh BUKAN Ayah (Misal: Ibu)
POST {{baseUrl}}/household_members
Authorization: Bearer {{token_ibu}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "household_id": "{{household_id}}",
  "user_id": "user-baru-lagi-id",
  "role": "anak",
  "display_name": "Anak Baru Lagi"
}

### 5. Uji 200: Hapus Anggota (Oleh Ayah)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/household_members/{{member_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_ayah}}
